<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's bids for Ballarat.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's bids for Ballarat.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd said on Wednesday that its Carlton and United Breweries unit would make a A$2.50 per share cash offer for Ballarat Brewing Co Ltd.  </p>
<p>The bid values Ballarat, which no longer has brewery interests but is involved in tourism and leisure operations, at A$67.74 million.</p>
<p>The offer by Foster's is also five cents per share above a hostile bid by Guinness Peat Group Plc.</p>
<p>Ballarat shares last traded at A$2.51 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Foster's is already the largest shareholder in Ballarat Brewing with a 41.6 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
